; Chapter 7 (docs/story.md section 0 item 7, section 4f), applied by ch7_cell.json. Out of the chamber
; Vegeta is player 1 and Trunks player 2 (the chamber exit, ch7_cell.json edit: every other character's selectable bit
; is cleared, so nobody else, Hercule included, can be player 2 before Perfect Cell's end). Semi-Perfect Cell
; (stat 76) splits into a Multi-Form duplicate in co-op (bosses.c default twin) and takes the fallen
; body back after the fight. After Cell's kick knocks Vegeta out, player 1 is Trunks (stock) and in co-op the pad that
; played Vegeta takes Krillin (CoopCall 6, 6 and 7, PadSwap); Perfect Cell (stats 78 / 79, no twin, ends at half
; health: bosses.c) knocks Krillin out with one hit at the start of the ending. Afterwards Trunks and Krillin are the
; default pair, Vegeta, Piccolo and Hercule selectable.
; Speakers: 1 the active character, 4 Vegeta (zone 12), 39 Semi-Perfect Cell, 40 Perfect Cell,
; 73 Krillin, 99 / 100 Trunks.
;
; Staging (Ryan, 2026-11-05: "characters shouldnt be stagnant", "account for 1p mode or 2p mode", "dont over-do it"). Lineups:
;   the fight with Semi-Perfect Cell: Vegeta alone, or Vegeta + Trunks. The scene after it: player 2's Trunks hands over to
;   his actor in the fade and flies in as he does alone, so both modes play one staging (player 2 has no entity in areas 5 and 6).
;   Perfect Cell: Trunks alone, or Trunks + Krillin. Krillin flies in in both modes. In co-op his actor lands on the spot where
;   player 2's entity respawns (12 px left of player 1, player.c ensure_p2), so the handover does not show; alone he keeps to
;   Vegeta's side through the fight and rushes from there. Vegeta's body lies on the field from the kick until he gets up.
;   Actor sprites moved here have the poses used (docs/sprites.md: 29 and 30 walk, 30 flies, 76 flies, punches, falls; 132 flies).
; Lines marked (draft) are Claude's, for Ryan to read.

; ---- zone 12 area 4: Vegeta (and Trunks) against Semi-Perfect Cell --------------------------------

sequence ch7_semi_perfect
  [0] stockseq @083e6620 0 0             ; Vegeta player 1 behind a fade (ch7_cell.json pre_edit), the music
  [1] script                             ; Cell turns; Vegeta walks up to him
        SetEntityFacing 29, 2
        WalkToPosition 0, 176, 300
        SetEntityFacing 0, 3
  [2] stockseq @083e6620 1 7             ; Cell and Vegeta, "It's obvious where your strength comes from", "the strongest being in the universe"
  [9] script                             ; Vegeta takes one more step
        WalkToPosition 0, 184, 300
        SetEntityFacing 0, 3
  [10] stockseq @083e6620 8 9            ; "a power not seen for thousands of years", "What is this?"
  [12] script                            ; stock entry 10 (its index moved). The power-up is the scene (it was the bare change and Cell walking
        CoopCall 37, 1, 0, 29            ; back two steps): a long charge with rings and dust, the change at its peak unless he came as a Super
        CoopCall 37, 7, 100, 2           ; Saiyan already, and Cell is pushed back to his mark in the hit-stun, not walking
        PushActiveCharIsTransformed
        JumpIfFalse L1
        Jump L2
      L1:
        SetEntityAnimation 0, 35
      L2:
        CoopCall 37, 15, 24, 0
        SetEntityAnimationNoWait 29, 2
        GlideToPosition 29, 216, 272, 100
        WaitFrames 16
        SetEntityAnimation 29, 0
        SetEntityFacing 29, 2
        SetEntityFacing 0, 3
  [13] stock @083e65f4                   ; "It's your end!"
  [14] script                            ; the first blow (batch 2, 7.2 beat 4): Vegeta is beside him in a blink and drives a fist into his
        PanCameraToPosition 71, 224, 4   ; body; Cell is thrown, gets up and is pushed back to his mark (the boss record and its twin start
        CoopCall 37, 1, 0, 29            ; from it). The camera is held where it is first: in this scene it follows player 1, and a dash
        CoopCall 37, 4, 0, 0             ; would drag it (entry 20 gives it back). Then co-op: the split (next 15), else the fight (20)
        CoopCall 37, 5, 5, 32
        CoopCall 37, 10, 1, 0
        WalkToPosition 29, 216, 272
        SetEntityFacing 29, 2
        CoopCall 5, 0, 0, 0
        JumpIfFalse L1
        PushByte 15
        END
      L1:
        PushByte 20
        END
  [15] text 39 "CELL: Two Saiyans against me?  Then I'll even the odds."
